			"notes": "## What's new\n\n- **API status**: indicator in the wallet and HUD, readable errors instead of \"—\", and gentler retries after 429/5xx.\n- **Amount input**: type `2ст 10` or `2:10`, see the amount in both formats, over-balance protection, and confirmation for large transfers.\n- **History**: log of your transfers and detected incoming money, kept locally (last 500).\n- **Templates and recent receivers**: one-click fill, Tab-completion of nicknames.\n- **Do Not Disturb**: hotkey/button/setting, summary when turned off, minimum-amount threshold, optional chat copy.\n- **Side panel**: new \"Quick / Log\" column, collapsible from the transfer header.\n- **Notifications** for your own transfers, with the comment shortened to 7 characters."
